  "html": "\n<div align=\"center\"><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\" width=\"630\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td height=\"10\" width=\"630\"><p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;</span></font><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><a name=\"top\"></a></span></font></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td background=\"/img/posts/site/skill_knowhow/images/memo_t.gif\" height=\"25\" width=\"630\"> <p><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><b><img align=\"absmiddle\" border=\"0\" height=\"24\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill_knowhow/images/u.gif\" width=\"24\">O. \n                            Combat&amp;Jobs</b></span></font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td background=\"/img/posts/site/skill_knowhow/images/memo_m.gif\" height=\"39\" width=\"630\"> <p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:60%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"black\">&nbsp;</font></p>\n<table align=\"center\" border=\"1\" bordercolordark=\"#666666\" bordercolorlight=\"black\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\" width=\"600\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td background=\"/img/posts/site/skill_knowhow/images/alpha_background_1.gif\" height=\"22\">\n<table align=\"center\" border=\"0\" bordercolordark=\"#666666\" bordercolorlight=\"black\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\" width=\"590\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td background=\"/img/posts/site/skill_knowhow/images/alpha_background.gif\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:50%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:0;\"><font color=\"black\">&nbsp;</font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:0;\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><a href=\"/site/skill_index/uo_combat_weapon/\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\">각종무기류(Sword,Mace,Fencing,Archery,Wrestling)</font></a></span></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:0;\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><a href=\"/site/skill_index/uo_combat_ta/\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\">전술(Tactics)</font></a><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"> \n                            l&nbsp;</font><a href=\"/site/skill_index/uo_combat_ana/\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\">해부학(Anatomy)</font></a><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"> \n                            l&nbsp;</font><a href=\"/site/skill_index/uo_combat_he/\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\">힐링(Healing)</font></a><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"> l </font><a href=\"/site/skill_index/uo_combat_focus/\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\">집중(Focus)</font></a><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"> l </font><a href=\"/site/skill_index/uo_combat_pa/\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\">방패술(Parry)</font></a></span></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:50%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:10; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font color=\"navy\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><b>FOCUS<img align=\"right\" border=\"0\" height=\"60\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill_index/images/logo_focus.gif\" width=\"100\">\n</b></span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:10; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font color=\"navy\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">직업 \n                            타이틀: Stoic</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:10; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font color=\"navy\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">사용시 \n                            주 상승 스탯: 없음</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:10; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font color=\"navy\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">사용시 \n                            부가 상승 스탯: 없음</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:10; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font color=\"navy\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">스킬사용 \n                            : Passive</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:10; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font color=\"navy\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">수련 \n                            가능 NPC: Paladin</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:10; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font color=\"navy\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">스킬 \n                            Up: 이동스킬</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:50%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><img align=\"absmiddle\" border=\"0\" height=\"15\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill_index/images/point.gif\" width=\"15\"> \n                            포커스(집중)는 스테미너와 마나가 차는 속도를 올려 \n                            주는 스킬입니다.</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">장점으로는 \n                            어떠한 방호구를 착용하여도 해당 속도를 줄이거나 \n                            멈추지 않는다는 것입니다.</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">포커스는 \n                            오직 패시브 스킬로 스킬을 사용하지 않고도 해당 스킬 \n                            수치만 있으면&nbsp;적용이 됩니다.</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:50%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font color=\"purple\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">포커스는 \n                            다음과 같은 공식으로 스테미너와 마나가 차게 됩니다.</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:50%; margin-top:0; margin-right:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<table align=\"center\" border=\"1\" bordercolordark=\"#666666\" bordercolorlight=\"black\" cellpadding=\"5\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin:0;\" width=\"500\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"#FFFFCC\">\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:5;\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">마나가 \n                                        차는 속도 = 포커스 스킬 20씩오를때마다 \n                                        초당 0.1씩 오르게 됩니다.</span></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:5;\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">스테미너가 \n                                        차는 속도 = 포커스 스킬 10씩오를때마다 \n                                        초당 0.1씩 오르게 됩니다.</span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p style=\"line-height:50%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">포커스는 \n                            주로 전사나, 운셋을 입는 테이머가 많이 쓰게 되며 \n                            특수기를 쓰거나 스테미너의 재생을 </span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">요구할때 \n                            쓰이지만, 스킬 총합이 700~720으로 한정되므로 해당 \n                            스킬을 꼭 올릴것인지는</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">고려하셔야 \n                            합니다.</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:50%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;</span></font></p>\n<table align=\"center\" border=\"1\" bordercolordark=\"black\" bordercolorlight=\"black\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"90%\">\n<tbody><tr height=\"18\" style=\"height:13.5pt\">\n<td background=\"/img/posts/site/skill_index/images/alpha_background_2.gif\" class=\"xl24\" colspan=\"13\" height=\"18\" style=\"height:13.5pt;\n  width:444pt\" width=\"596\">\n<p align=\"center\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">FOCUS</span></font></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr height=\"18\" style=\"height:13.5pt\">\n<td background=\"/img/posts/site/skill_index/images/alpha_background_2.gif\" class=\"xl24\" height=\"18\" style=\"height:13.5pt;border-top:none;\n  width:60pt\" width=\"80\">\n<p align=\"center\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;</span></font></p></td>\n<td background=\"/img/posts/site/skill_index/images/alpha_background_2.gif\" class=\"xl24\" style=\"border-top:none;border-left:none;width:32pt\" width=\"43\">\n<p align=\"center\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">10</span></font></p></td>\n<td background=\"/img/posts/site/skill_index/images/alpha_background_2.gif\" class=\"xl24\" style=\"border-top:none;border-left:none;width:32pt\" width=\"43\">\n<p align=\"center\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">20</span></font></p></td>\n<td background=\"/img/posts/site/skill_index/images/alpha_background_2.gif\" class=\"xl24\" style=\"border-top:none;border-left:none;width:32pt\" width=\"43\">\n<p align=\"center\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">30</span></font></p></td>\n<td background=\"/img/posts/site/skill_index/images/alpha_background_2.gif\" class=\"xl24\" style=\"border-top:none;border-left:none;width:32pt\" width=\"43\">\n<p align=\"center\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span styl